Info: 
Usage: openETPServer [global-options] hdf5 --info file.h5
Usage: openETPServer [global-options] hdf5 --diff file1.h5 --with file2.h5

Actions:
  -h [ --help ]                     Display this information
  --info arg                        Prints HDF5 file statistics
  --stats arg                       Prints per-Dataset-type statistics
  --diff arg                        Diffs two HDF5 files' dataset's metadata & 
                                    bytes
                                    (Ignores chunking, compression, attributes,
                                    etc...)

Options:
  --top arg (=10)                   How many entry to list
  --with arg                        Which HDF5 file to diff against
  -M [ --max-buf-size ] arg (=1MB)  Maximum buffer size in bytes
  --force                           Continue instead of exit, on some 
                                    warnings/errors

OSDU Partition Options:
  -P [ --data-partition-id ] arg    OSDU data partition name.

